# =============================================================================
#   FILE    : defiantlooter/.gitignore
#   PACKAGE : Defiant Looter Lua (MacroQuest / EverQuest)
#   VERSION : 1.0.1
#   WHAT    : Files git should never upload.
#   WHY     : Keeps the repository to source and documentation only. Python
#             cache files from the dev tools and editor clutter add noise.
#   WHERE   : Root of the repository (the defiantlooter folder).
#   HOW     : One pattern per line; # starts a comment.
#   WHEN    : Read by git on every commit.
# =============================================================================

# Python cache created when dev/doc_audit.py or dev/run_tests.py runs.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Packaged zips are built from the source; the source is what gets versioned.
*.zip

# Per character settings files, in case one is ever copied here by mistake.
# The real ones live in <MacroQuest>/config/, never in this folder.
defiantlooter_*.lua
Loot.ini

# Editor and operating system clutter.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# =============================================================================
#   END OF FILE : defiantlooter/.gitignore
# =============================================================================
